        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "Better go to Yuen Kee next to it. Being worse after changed the name, food very so-so. The claypot rice is just like normal rice serving in the claypot, even not hot enough. The first restaurant I do not recommend on google maps.\n\n強烈建議去隔離間苑記。轉名之後食物大不如前。煲仔飯就好似只係用個煲裝住，完全冇煲仔飯嘅感覺。白灼柏葉都唔好食。第一次喺google maps勸大家唔好去\n黎。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
